<title>JAPAN: AuBEX -6mth parent forecast.</title>
<headline>AuBEX -6mth parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    PREVIOUS	   ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	   FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		  3.72		 3.93		 3.80</p>
<p> Current	     11    million	  30    million	  17    million</p>
<p> Net		    8    million	  25    million	  26    million</p>
<p>NOTE - AuBEX Corp started out as a hat maker, but is now shifting emphasis to textile products.</p>
</text>
